"Enabled" = "已启用";
"When off, KeyAwake leaves every link alone." = "关闭后，KeyAwake 不会改动任何链路。";
"Bluetooth LE devices" = "蓝牙 LE 设备";
"Only keyboards are boosted. On macOS 27, requesting low latency for a pointing device as well makes the system push the keyboard back to its idle latency." = "仅加速键盘。在 macOS 27 上，如果同时为指针设备请求低延迟，系统会把键盘推回其空闲延迟。";
