"Performance" = "性能";
"Link latency" = "链路延迟";
"Release when idle" = "空闲多久后释放";
"%@ · worst case ~%d ms" = "%1$@ · 最坏情况约 %2$d 毫秒";
"Worst case ~%d ms instead of 30. Noticeable while typing, but easier on the battery." = "最坏情况约 %d 毫秒，而非 30 毫秒。打字时能感觉到，但更省电。";
"Worst case ~%d ms instead of 30. That is slower than the bug KeyAwake fixes (345 ms), so your keyboard will be worse off than without the app." = "最坏情况约 %d 毫秒，而非 30 毫秒。这比 KeyAwake 修复的故障（345 毫秒）还慢，键盘会比不用这个应用时更糟。";
"After releasing, the keyboard goes back to saving power. The next keystroke arrives a little late; everything after it is instant." = "释放后，键盘会恢复省电。下一次按键会稍晚到达；之后的一切都是即时的。";
